   },
   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:13:08+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "הָעֵד הֵעִד is an infinitive absolute plus finite verb (emphatic): 'he solemnly warned'. The KJV 'solemnly protest' is sound; I kept the doubled root visible in the literal layer ('warning he warned'). Rashi and Radak read it as a formal legal warning before witnesses."
   ],
   "history": [],
   "source": null
  },
  "verse.en:GEN.43.4": {
   "status": "draft",
   "produced_by": {
