   },
   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:13:08+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "STEPBible glosses יֶשְׁךָ as 'there you', which is not English; 'if there is you sending' is the structural sense (yesh + participle). I glossed it 'if there is you'."
   ],
   "history": [],
   "source": null
  },
