   "agent_notes": [
    "The KJV's 'tenor of these words' renders עַל־פִּי, literally 'on the mouth of'. I kept 'mouth' in the literal layer. Rashi's gloss on 'ki yomar' (ki = 'that/if') is cited for the sense of the last clause."
   ],
